function mergeIn(o){if(!o)return;function mx(a,b){for(var k in b){if(typeof b[k]==='number')a[k]=Math.max(a[k]||0,b[k]);else if(b[k]&&!a[k])a[k]=b[k];}}
  D.xp=Math.max(D.xp,o.xp||0);D.perfect=Math.max(D.perfect||0,o.perfect||0);['done','sets','kids','qz','kg','lv'].forEach(function(k){D[k]=D[k]||{};if(o[k])mx(D[k],o[k]);});
  (o.days||[]).forEach(function(d){if(D.days.indexOf(d)<0)D.days.push(d);});if(o.td&&o.td.d===today()&&(!D.td||D.td.d!==today()||o.td.xp>D.td.xp))D.td=o.td;
  if(o.hist){D.hist=D.hist||{};for(var hk in o.hist)D.hist[hk]=Math.max(D.hist[hk]||0,o.hist[hk]||0);}
  if(o.gram){D.gram=D.gram||{};for(var gk in o.gram){var ga=D.gram[gk]||{},gb=o.gram[gk]||{};D.gram[gk]={b:Math.max(ga.b||0,gb.b||0),n:Math.max(ga.n||0,gb.n||0),r:Math.max(ga.r||0,gb.r||0),t:Math.max(ga.t||0,gb.t||0)};}}
  if(o.gmiss){D.gmiss=D.gmiss||[];o.gmiss.forEach(function(x){if(D.gmiss.indexOf(x)<0)D.gmiss.push(x);});D.gmiss=D.gmiss.slice(-80);}
  if(o.vb){D.vb=D.vb||{};for(var vk in o.vb){var ve=D.vb[vk],vf=o.vb[vk];if(vf&&(!ve||(vf[3]||0)>(ve[3]||0)))D.vb[vk]=vf;}}
  if(o.vmode&&!D.vmode)D.vmode=o.vmode;}
